{"3555620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LoudShot", "steam_appid": 3555620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LoudShot is a high-impact <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/e216cc0c50870258f61a5676d1249e6b.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1152 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/e216cc0c50870258f61a5676d1249e6b.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/e216cc0c50870258f61a5676d1249e6b.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FPS where every hit counts and every weapon comes from the last enemy you dropped. Fights are short, aggressive, and punish hesitation. You move, strike, swap weapons, and break through each encounter before enemies even adjust.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/05c085132c910fd36727c7795a95d6d9.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/05c085132c910fd36727c7795a95d6d9.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/05c085132c910fd36727c7795a95d6d9.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement keeps you alive. You push forward, close gaps fast, and never settle in one spot. You jump, dash, slide, and carve through hostile spaces built to keep you thinking on your feet. If you slow down, enemies catch you instantly.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/129c776c4c232d88d0ea6aa9142e9519.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/129c776c4c232d88d0ea6aa9142e9519.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/129c776c4c232d88d0ea6aa9142e9519.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every weapon has its own twist. Some hit harder up close, some set up bigger plays, and each one comes with a unique move that lets you handle situations in different ways.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/70cf6e79e6eb2762ae520602035faf7c.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/70cf6e79e6eb2762ae520602035faf7c.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/70cf6e79e6eb2762ae520602035faf7c.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level builds pressure and ends with a score based on how well you kept your pace. Air kills, quick clears, and switching weapons all raise your final rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/4f09da23d99b779a512720f78d78c293.avif?t=1787396266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras_big/4f09da23d99b779a512720f78d78c293.webp?t=1787396266 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses hit harder and force you to change how you move. Every one uses a different style, pushes a different pattern, and only goes down once you figure out their weak point. When you see the opening, you strike fast and end it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LoudShot is a high-impact <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/e216cc0c50870258f61a5676d1249e6b.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1152 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/e216cc0c50870258f61a5676d1249e6b.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/e216cc0c50870258f61a5676d1249e6b.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>FPS where every hit counts and every weapon comes from the last enemy you dropped. Fights are short, aggressive, and punish hesitation. You move, strike, swap weapons, and break through each encounter before enemies even adjust.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/05c085132c910fd36727c7795a95d6d9.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/05c085132c910fd36727c7795a95d6d9.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/05c085132c910fd36727c7795a95d6d9.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement keeps you alive. You push forward, close gaps fast, and never settle in one spot. You jump, dash, slide, and carve through hostile spaces built to keep you thinking on your feet. If you slow down, enemies catch you instantly.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/129c776c4c232d88d0ea6aa9142e9519.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/129c776c4c232d88d0ea6aa9142e9519.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/129c776c4c232d88d0ea6aa9142e9519.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every weapon has its own twist. Some hit harder up close, some set up bigger plays, and each one comes with a unique move that lets you handle situations in different ways.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/70cf6e79e6eb2762ae520602035faf7c.poster.avif?t=1787396266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/70cf6e79e6eb2762ae520602035faf7c.webm?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/70cf6e79e6eb2762ae520602035faf7c.mp4?t=1787396266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level builds pressure and ends with a score based on how well you kept your pace. Air kills, quick clears, and switching weapons all raise your final rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras/4f09da23d99b779a512720f78d78c293.avif?t=1787396266\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/extras_big/4f09da23d99b779a512720f78d78c293.webp?t=1787396266 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses hit harder and force you to change how you move. Every one uses a different style, pushes a different pattern, and only goes down once you figure out their weak point. When you see the opening, you strike fast and end it.</p>", "short_description": "LoudShot is a fast-pace FPS where every hit counts and every weapon comes from the last enemy you dropped. Fights are aggressive and fast. you hit hard, move fast, switch weapons constantly and use the environment to assist you in the fight. slowing down is the quickest way to get killed.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Bulgarian, Danish, Finnish, Hungarian, Japanese, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Swedish, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/4f8d9a3f7d75c06ed49e10577abc4962b4a744c1/header.jpg?t=1787396266", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/00c8f224289047164e1353325e29cb8ed1cfc5a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787396266", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555620/00c8f224289047164e1353325e29cb8ed1cfc5a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787396266", "website": "https://exouch.com/work/loudshot", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 190